OL,3,APlanes grounded at Gatwick after
OL,4,Aaircraft stuck on runway
OL,5,
OL,6,FFlights at Gatwick Airport were brought
OL,7,Fto a standstill for nearly an hour
OL,8,Fafter a plane became stuck on the
OL,9,Frunway.
OL,11,FA Gatwick spokesperson said the runway
OL,12,Fwas closed on Friday afternoon because
OL,13,Fof a "technical issue with a departing
OL,14,Fvehicle".
OL,16,FThe airport said the runway remained
OL,17,Fclosed for 50 minutes while the plane
OL,18,Fwas towed away before reopening shortly
OL,19,Fafterwards. Some flights were diverted
OL,20,Fto other airports including London
OL,21,FStansted and Birmingham.
OL,23,APub: 04-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
